1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:05,088
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,764
[laughs]

3
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:35,285
[Helena] <i>Each and every one of you</i>

4
00:00:35,368 --> 00:00:37,787
<i>has a reason to betray me.</i>

5
00:00:37,871 --> 00:00:40,915
[Emilia] <i>Eeny, meeny, miny, moe.</i>

6
00:00:40,999 --> 00:00:42,083
<i>Moe, moe!</i>

7
00:00:42,167 --> 00:00:44,294
[Diego] <i>Red Dragon didn't kill Mercedes.</i>

8
00:00:44,377 --> 00:00:47,005
<i>Someone else was there.</i>
<i>That person killed Mercedes.</i>

9
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:51,259
[Julio] <i>Who else knows that you're back?</i>

10
00:00:51,342 --> 00:00:52,802
<i>It's just Mom and Grandma.</i>

11
00:00:52,886 --> 00:00:56,639
<i>They'll never suspect they've</i>
<i>let a wolf into their midst.</i>

12
00:00:56,723 --> 00:00:58,683
[Camia] <i>They found the corpse</i>

13
00:00:58,767 --> 00:00:59,934
<i>of one of Red Dragon's people,</i>

14
00:01:00,018 --> 00:01:01,519
<i>and they can't identify whose body it is.</i>

15
00:01:01,603 --> 00:01:03,271
[Emilia] <i>Don't feel bad. It's her fault.</i>

16
00:01:03,354 --> 00:01:04,147
<i>She's a traitor.</i>

17
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:06,232
[Lily] <i>I tried to convince her</i>
<i>to join my side,</i>

18
00:01:06,316 --> 00:01:09,569
<i>but she refused and chose</i>
<i>to side with the demon.</i>

19
00:01:09,652 --> 00:01:12,030
[Jaguar] <i>Red Dragon didn't</i>
<i>come back to kill Mercedes,</i>

20
00:01:12,113 --> 00:01:14,532
<i>or to have the Big Four's</i>
<i>deaths investigated.</i>

21
00:01:14,616 --> 00:01:16,534
<i>There will be an important transaction.</i>

22
00:01:16,618 --> 00:01:18,286
[Diego] <i>This could be our last chance</i>

23
00:01:18,369 --> 00:01:19,954
<i>to take down Red Dragon.</i>

24
00:01:20,038 --> 00:01:21,414
<i>She has a huge transaction coming up.</i>

25
00:01:21,498 --> 00:01:22,707
<i>We have to catch her.</i>

26
00:01:22,791 --> 00:01:24,876
[Lily] <i>That's why we can't fail.</i>

27
00:01:25,752 --> 00:01:27,128
<i>-Lily.</i>
<i>-Arnaldo.</i>

28
00:01:27,712 --> 00:01:29,714
[Arnaldo] <i>You haven't changed, Lily.</i>

29
00:01:29,798 --> 00:01:30,882
<i>You still smell so good</i>

30
00:01:30,965 --> 00:01:33,843
<i>even though you're rotten to the core.</i>

31
00:01:43,353 --> 00:01:44,562
Hey, Jepoy.

32
00:01:47,023 --> 00:01:48,233
What are you doing here?

33
00:01:48,858 --> 00:01:50,985
I'm here to get the firearms I bought.

34
00:01:51,069 --> 00:01:53,154
I've already paid in full.
I really need them now.

35
00:01:53,238 --> 00:01:55,365
-Where are they?
-Yes, I know that.

36
00:01:55,448 --> 00:01:57,325
But I already gave them
to your friend last night.

37
00:01:57,408 --> 00:01:59,494
Wait, what? Which friend
are you talking about?

38
00:01:59,577 --> 00:02:01,704
Remember who introduced me to you?

39
00:02:01,788 --> 00:02:03,289
It was Natalie.

40
00:02:04,332 --> 00:02:05,500
Natalie?

41
00:02:05,583 --> 00:02:06,501
Yes.

42
00:02:06,584 --> 00:02:09,254
[tense music playing]

43
00:02:11,381 --> 00:02:13,174
Okay, bro. Sorry for the trouble.

44
00:02:13,258 --> 00:02:14,384
I'll just call Natalie.

45
00:02:14,467 --> 00:02:15,802
All right, bro. Drive safely.

46
00:02:16,386 --> 00:02:18,012
Give her my regards, okay?

47
00:02:18,096 --> 00:02:20,849
[tense music continues]

48
00:02:28,857 --> 00:02:30,859
[line rings]

49
00:02:30,942 --> 00:02:35,071
[phone ringing]

50
00:02:38,908 --> 00:02:42,078
[phone continues ringing]

51
00:02:42,162 --> 00:02:43,538
Madrigal.

52
00:02:49,085 --> 00:02:51,254
[sensual music playing]

53
00:02:51,337 --> 00:02:52,797
Hello, lover.

54
00:02:52,881 --> 00:02:54,799
Where are my weapons?

55
00:02:55,884 --> 00:02:59,345
I have it. So come and get it.

56
00:02:59,888 --> 00:03:01,931
I need them now, so give them back.

57
00:03:02,015 --> 00:03:03,016
Why did you take them?

58
00:03:03,099 --> 00:03:04,267
Um…

59
00:03:05,476 --> 00:03:07,353
Because I was lonely,

60
00:03:07,437 --> 00:03:09,898
<i>and I want it to compensate…</i>

61
00:03:09,981 --> 00:03:12,066
…for my loneliness.

62
00:03:12,567 --> 00:03:17,488
And I miss you a lot, Madrigal.

63
00:03:18,740 --> 00:03:21,200
You know, you're really nuts.

64
00:03:21,784 --> 00:03:23,786
I need those weapons, Natalie.

65
00:03:23,870 --> 00:03:26,748
I paid for them, so give them back to me.

66
00:03:27,248 --> 00:03:28,374
Well…

67
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:32,587
If you want it, come and get it.

68
00:03:32,670 --> 00:03:35,173
[laughs]

69
00:03:35,256 --> 00:03:36,883
You know what, Natalie?

70
00:03:37,383 --> 00:03:39,510
Since you took them,

71
00:03:40,386 --> 00:03:42,972
I think it's better
if you bring them back.

72
00:03:43,598 --> 00:03:46,100
Oh, I love it when you get mad.

73
00:03:46,601 --> 00:03:51,689
Well, if you want it, then I'll be there.

74
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:54,484
Bye, lover boy.

75
00:03:54,984 --> 00:03:57,445
[sensual music playing]

76
00:04:00,531 --> 00:04:02,158
[suspenseful music playing]

77
00:04:02,242 --> 00:04:04,202
According to our insider,

78
00:04:04,285 --> 00:04:07,622
Red Dragon's transaction
will take place tonight.

79
00:04:08,248 --> 00:04:12,252
So, prepare everything
for tonight's operation, okay?

80
00:04:13,002 --> 00:04:14,087
Dismissed.

81
00:04:14,170 --> 00:04:15,463
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

82
00:04:25,181 --> 00:04:27,016
Agent Salonga,

83
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:30,228
Red Dragon will be
transporting innocent civilians.

84
00:04:30,812 --> 00:04:32,689
So please be careful.

85
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:36,484
Most of them are minors,
and they're being smuggled

86
00:04:36,567 --> 00:04:38,069
to different parts of the world.

87
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:41,114
We'll make sure to save all of them.

88
00:04:41,781 --> 00:04:43,366
Including your insider friend.

89
00:04:46,869 --> 00:04:48,371
Give this to your friend.

90
00:04:49,539 --> 00:04:51,040
It's a wiretapping device.

91
00:04:51,124 --> 00:04:52,792
That way, we can record and listen in

92
00:04:52,875 --> 00:04:54,252
on Red Dragon's transaction.

93
00:04:55,086 --> 00:04:57,380
Then, once we've collected
enough evidence,

94
00:04:57,463 --> 00:04:59,924
we'll break in and arrest her.

95
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:03,011
[suspenseful music playing]

96
00:05:09,892 --> 00:05:11,311
Hurry and get them out of here.

97
00:05:11,394 --> 00:05:12,895
Come on, move it!

98
00:05:13,730 --> 00:05:14,939
Faster!

99
00:05:17,650 --> 00:05:18,818
Hurry up!

100
00:05:22,238 --> 00:05:23,489
-Madam.
-[Emilia] Make sure…

101
00:05:23,573 --> 00:05:24,949
With all due respect…

102
00:05:25,450 --> 00:05:28,036
I know how important
this transaction is to you.

103
00:05:29,329 --> 00:05:31,914
Yes. My reputation is at stake.

104
00:05:33,833 --> 00:05:37,170
That is why I don't think Emilia
should be in charge of this.

105
00:05:37,795 --> 00:05:39,505
She's too inexperienced.

106
00:05:40,214 --> 00:05:42,091
Are you questioning my decision?

107
00:05:43,092 --> 00:05:44,552
Ah… No, Madam.

108
00:05:45,011 --> 00:05:47,305
Emilia will eventually lead our group,

109
00:05:47,388 --> 00:05:50,683
so I want you to respect her
the way you respect me.

110
00:05:51,142 --> 00:05:52,143
Do you understand?

111
00:05:53,269 --> 00:05:54,395
Yes, Madam.

112
00:05:54,854 --> 00:05:56,022
My apologies.

113
00:05:56,105 --> 00:05:58,566
[tense music playing]

114
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:12,080
[door opens]

115
00:06:12,163 --> 00:06:14,999
[Jaguar's lackey] <i>Boss,</i>
<i>Romulo's looking for you.</i>

116
00:06:15,875 --> 00:06:18,169
Jeez, I'm on my way, okay?

117
00:06:18,252 --> 00:06:19,295
Hey, Boss.

118
00:06:20,463 --> 00:06:21,380
Are you still there?

119
00:06:22,090 --> 00:06:23,382
[coughs]

120
00:06:23,466 --> 00:06:25,510
Ah… I'm sick.

121
00:06:25,593 --> 00:06:27,220
Just take charge while I'm gone.

122
00:06:28,387 --> 00:06:30,389
But, Boss, what are we supposed to do?

123
00:06:31,933 --> 00:06:35,019
What are you? Newbies?
You guys know how this goes.

124
00:06:35,394 --> 00:06:36,646
But, Boss…

125
00:06:36,729 --> 00:06:37,730
You can handle it.

126
00:06:38,314 --> 00:06:39,398
[coughs]

127
00:06:39,482 --> 00:06:40,900
Anyway, I'm hanging up.

128
00:06:40,983 --> 00:06:43,027
My throat's sore,
and I need to take a pill.

129
00:06:49,659 --> 00:06:51,160
Get down from there, Mariano.

130
00:06:51,244 --> 00:06:53,287
It's still uneven, let me do it.

131
00:06:53,371 --> 00:06:55,081
But you might fall, ma'am.

132
00:06:55,164 --> 00:06:56,999
I won't. This isn't my first time.

133
00:06:57,083 --> 00:06:59,877
Now, get down from there.
See? It's just not even.

134
00:06:59,961 --> 00:07:01,462
-But ma'am, it's dangerous.
-I'm fine.

135
00:07:01,546 --> 00:07:02,880
-Camia.
-I can handle it. What?

136
00:07:02,964 --> 00:07:04,006
Careful.

137
00:07:04,882 --> 00:07:07,051
On a step ladder? I'll be fine, Damian.

138
00:07:08,886 --> 00:07:09,887
[Damian] Hey.

139
00:07:15,059 --> 00:07:16,352
There.

140
00:07:16,436 --> 00:07:18,688
-Nice.
-There, all done.

141
00:07:18,771 --> 00:07:21,023
Mariano, please turn
these Christmas lights on

142
00:07:21,107 --> 00:07:23,443
-so we can see how it looks.
-Help me out, Dang.

143
00:07:25,653 --> 00:07:28,239
-See, Damian? It's easy.
-Careful.

144
00:07:28,322 --> 00:07:29,282
Oh!

145
00:07:29,365 --> 00:07:31,492
[romantic music playing]

146
00:08:07,778 --> 00:08:09,030
[door opens]

147
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,283
[door closes]

148
00:08:17,330 --> 00:08:18,873
Looks like this isn't stable enough.

149
00:08:20,666 --> 00:08:22,585
-They're beautiful.
-Right?

150
00:08:22,668 --> 00:08:23,669
Yes, sir.

151
00:08:23,753 --> 00:08:26,172
[romantic music playing]

152
00:08:27,256 --> 00:08:28,257
[clears throat]

153
00:08:30,259 --> 00:08:31,385
[clears throat]

154
00:08:35,473 --> 00:08:37,600
Diego, you have to wear

155
00:08:37,683 --> 00:08:39,268
this wiretapping device at all times

156
00:08:39,352 --> 00:08:41,812
so we can listen in on your conversations

157
00:08:41,896 --> 00:08:43,022
with Red Dragon.

158
00:08:44,065 --> 00:08:47,443
We'll only attack after
you give us the go signal.

159
00:08:47,527 --> 00:08:50,446
Also, if something doesn't go as planned,

160
00:08:50,530 --> 00:08:52,073
we'll be there right away.

161
00:08:53,574 --> 00:08:54,909
We can't afford to fail, Lily.

162
00:08:55,451 --> 00:08:58,037
We have to catch Red Dragon in the act.

163
00:09:02,166 --> 00:09:04,502
You have to be careful, Diego.

164
00:09:05,378 --> 00:09:08,589
Your safety is more important.

165
00:09:10,883 --> 00:09:13,553
Lily, I trusted you before.

166
00:09:13,636 --> 00:09:16,389
So, this time, can you trust me too?

167
00:09:17,265 --> 00:09:18,724
Nothing bad is gonna happen to me.

168
00:09:18,808 --> 00:09:20,142
You won't lose me.

169
00:09:20,226 --> 00:09:23,938
I do trust you. But, please,
let me protect you.

170
00:09:24,939 --> 00:09:26,732
I just want to make sure you're safe.

171
00:09:28,109 --> 00:09:29,235
I know.

172
00:09:29,652 --> 00:09:31,696
Stay safe, Diego.

173
00:09:33,155 --> 00:09:36,993
This will be the last time
we'll ever be apart.

174
00:09:37,368 --> 00:09:40,830
After this, you're finally
coming back to me.

175
00:09:41,289 --> 00:09:44,750
[tense music playing]

176
00:09:47,086 --> 00:09:48,504
Okay. Take care.

177
00:10:12,945 --> 00:10:16,449
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" instrumental playing]

178
00:10:23,748 --> 00:10:26,500
[Diego] <i>All your battles</i>
<i>are my battles, Lily.</i>

179
00:10:27,585 --> 00:10:30,129
<i>We've been partners since we were kids.</i>

180
00:10:31,255 --> 00:10:32,715
<i>I know how brave you are,</i>

181
00:10:33,466 --> 00:10:36,135
<i>but I'll still do whatever</i>
<i>I can to protect you.</i>

182
00:10:40,389 --> 00:10:41,766
<i>Don't go back there anymore.</i>

183
00:10:41,849 --> 00:10:43,225
<i>Don't worry, Lily.</i>

184
00:10:43,684 --> 00:10:45,269
<i>Nothing bad is gonna happen to me.</i>

185
00:10:48,356 --> 00:10:50,983
<i>I'll do everything I can in this mission</i>

186
00:10:51,067 --> 00:10:52,735
<i>so we can be together again.</i>

187
00:10:53,653 --> 00:10:55,071
<i>And after tonight,</i>

188
00:10:55,863 --> 00:10:57,365
<i>I won't waste a moment.</i>

189
00:10:58,157 --> 00:11:01,077
<i>I'll show you just how much I love you.</i>

190
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:03,412
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" instrumental playing]

191
00:11:16,342 --> 00:11:19,887
<i>You've always been by</i>
<i>my side since the start, Diego.</i>

192
00:11:20,388 --> 00:11:23,933
<i>You were always there</i>
<i>to help me in all my battles.</i>

193
00:11:24,683 --> 00:11:27,895
<i>You're ready to risk your own life for me.</i>

194
00:11:30,314 --> 00:11:32,483
<i>-Are you okay?</i>
<i>-I'm fine.</i>

195
00:11:32,566 --> 00:11:34,068
<i>Stop this wedding!</i>

196
00:11:34,151 --> 00:11:37,154
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" instrumental playing]

197
00:11:45,454 --> 00:11:46,580
<i>So, this time…</i>

198
00:11:47,373 --> 00:11:49,333
<i>I'm going to make it up to you.</i>

199
00:11:50,084 --> 00:11:52,503
<i>This time, I'll make sure</i>
<i>you'll be able to escape</i>

200
00:11:52,586 --> 00:11:54,171
<i>Red Dragon's syndicate.</i>

201
00:11:54,964 --> 00:11:58,676
<i>I won't let anything</i>
<i>bad happen to you, Diego.</i>

202
00:12:04,598 --> 00:12:07,518
[ominous music playing]

203
00:12:10,688 --> 00:12:12,565
Mama, everything is ready. We can go now.

204
00:12:13,190 --> 00:12:15,943
Oh! That is okay, baby girl.
I'll take it from here.

205
00:12:18,654 --> 00:12:20,364
Am I not working hard enough, Mama?

206
00:12:21,824 --> 00:12:24,076
[scoffs] No, you're doing great.

207
00:12:24,952 --> 00:12:27,496
It's just that the buyer
wants to meet me personally.

208
00:12:27,997 --> 00:12:31,041
So, why don't you just stay here
and hold the fort while I'm gone?

209
00:12:32,501 --> 00:12:36,213
Baby girl, I'm so proud of you.

210
00:12:37,089 --> 00:12:38,007
Thank you, Mama.

211
00:12:38,883 --> 00:12:41,635
[ominous music playing]

212
00:12:44,972 --> 00:12:48,100
[suspenseful music swells]

213
00:13:11,790 --> 00:13:16,170
Remember, we'll wait for the go
signal of Lily Cruz's contact.

214
00:13:16,545 --> 00:13:17,755
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

215
00:13:18,172 --> 00:13:21,091
[tense music playing]

216
00:13:31,769 --> 00:13:34,939
[soft piano music playing]

217
00:13:37,525 --> 00:13:38,526
<i>Oh!</i>

218
00:13:50,829 --> 00:13:53,958
[soft piano music continues]

219
00:14:06,470 --> 00:14:08,138
<i>Hey! My bag!</i>

220
00:14:09,890 --> 00:14:12,142
<i>-Call the cops!</i>
<i>-Officer!</i>

221
00:14:13,352 --> 00:14:15,646
<i>Here's your bag. It's good as new, miss.</i>

222
00:14:16,230 --> 00:14:18,107
<i>-Thank you.</i>
<i>-I'm Damian, by the way.</i>

223
00:14:18,190 --> 00:14:21,068
<i>-Camia.</i>
<i>-Camia. Camia.</i>

224
00:14:21,151 --> 00:14:22,820
[soft piano music continues]

225
00:14:34,665 --> 00:14:36,750
[groaning]

226
00:14:40,796 --> 00:14:43,465
[Damian] <i>Camia, believe me. I've changed.</i>

227
00:14:43,883 --> 00:14:46,385
<i>I'm not a criminal anymore.</i>

228
00:14:46,927 --> 00:14:50,306
<i>I live a completely different life now.</i>

229
00:14:50,389 --> 00:14:53,809
[Camia] <i>I'll give you a chance</i>
<i>to prove yourself.</i>

230
00:14:53,893 --> 00:14:55,686
[Damian] <i>Is there anything</i>
<i>I can do to help?</i>

231
00:14:55,769 --> 00:14:57,605
<i>Thank you for coming.</i>

232
00:14:57,688 --> 00:14:59,857
<i>I'll do anything for you and Lily.</i>

233
00:15:01,775 --> 00:15:04,486
[soft piano music continues]

234
00:15:12,286 --> 00:15:13,287
[Camia] <i>Damian.</i>

235
00:15:13,746 --> 00:15:18,500
<i>Forgive me for thinking badly of you.</i>

236
00:15:18,584 --> 00:15:23,130
<i>If you love someone, you</i>
<i>need to express how you feel,</i>

237
00:15:23,213 --> 00:15:25,841
<i>so you won't have any regrets.</i>

238
00:15:27,718 --> 00:15:30,512
[soft piano music continues]

239
00:15:36,685 --> 00:15:38,228
<i>I love you, Camia.</i>

240
00:15:38,771 --> 00:15:40,898
<i>And I know you feel something for me too.</i>

241
00:15:40,981 --> 00:15:43,317
<i>But why do you keep holding back?</i>

242
00:15:43,734 --> 00:15:45,402
<i>Is it because of my past?</i>

243
00:15:45,903 --> 00:15:47,529
<i>Is it because I don't deserve you?</i>

244
00:15:55,996 --> 00:15:59,833
<i>I don't understand</i>
<i>my feelings for you, Damian.</i>

245
00:16:01,377 --> 00:16:03,128
<i>I know I can't fall for you.</i>

246
00:16:04,171 --> 00:16:06,006
<i>My life fell apart when Dante died,</i>

247
00:16:06,090 --> 00:16:08,509
<i>and I don't think I can love again.</i>

248
00:16:09,009 --> 00:16:11,887
[soft piano music continues]

249
00:16:18,894 --> 00:16:20,312
[music fades]

250
00:16:28,445 --> 00:16:29,405
Camia.

251
00:16:31,824 --> 00:16:32,825
Is something wrong?

252
00:16:40,249 --> 00:16:42,584
I'm just worried about Lily.

253
00:16:42,668 --> 00:16:45,087
[melancholic music playing]

254
00:16:45,170 --> 00:16:47,214
They'll bust Red Dragon tonight.

255
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:53,512
Damian, I know my daughter is doing this

256
00:16:53,595 --> 00:16:56,598
because she wants all of us
to live a peaceful life.

257
00:16:58,600 --> 00:17:00,436
And I trust her.

258
00:17:02,563 --> 00:17:05,274
I know she can take on her enemies.

259
00:17:06,650 --> 00:17:09,069
And that all her sacrifices will pay off.

260
00:17:11,864 --> 00:17:13,824
All of this will be worth it.

261
00:17:15,951 --> 00:17:18,954
[suspenseful music playing]

262
00:17:37,973 --> 00:17:39,892
Madam, they're here.

263
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:44,646
Mr. Han.

264
00:17:45,647 --> 00:17:47,816
All 200 people that you've ordered…

265
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:49,610
<i>…are already accounted for.</i>

266
00:17:49,693 --> 00:17:51,070
[Mr. Han] <i>I'm impressed.</i>

267
00:17:51,653 --> 00:17:54,698
<i>Master will be pleased to know</i>
<i>about this transaction,</i>

268
00:17:54,782 --> 00:17:55,741
<i>especially now…</i>

269
00:17:55,824 --> 00:17:57,284
…that you're back in control.

270
00:17:57,367 --> 00:18:00,579
Yes, we had a bit
of an infestation problem.

271
00:18:00,662 --> 00:18:02,498
But now that we are pest-free,

272
00:18:02,581 --> 00:18:04,708
all operations are back in control.

273
00:18:04,792 --> 00:18:07,503
-I never doubted you.
-Thank you, Mr. Han.

274
00:18:07,586 --> 00:18:08,712
Flattery is cheap.

275
00:18:08,796 --> 00:18:12,591
But then, what I need is
what we've already discussed.

276
00:18:12,674 --> 00:18:14,301
Oh, right. Okay.

277
00:18:14,384 --> 00:18:15,511
Coming.

278
00:18:16,261 --> 00:18:18,263
Agent Salonga, what are we waiting for?

279
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:21,975
We need to wait till Red Dragon
is holding the payment herself.

280
00:18:22,601 --> 00:18:25,562
Don't worry. Our intel is
already there waiting to attack.

281
00:18:25,896 --> 00:18:28,107
[suspenseful music playing]

282
00:18:34,154 --> 00:18:35,197
That's all yours.

283
00:18:50,003 --> 00:18:51,338
-[Mr. Han] <i>Did you like it?</i>
-[Helena chuckles]

284
00:18:51,421 --> 00:18:53,090
-My besties.
-Oh, right.

285
00:18:53,173 --> 00:18:54,466
[Helena] <i>They're beautiful.</i>

286
00:18:55,217 --> 00:18:56,385
[Mr. Tan] I'm happy.

287
00:18:57,094 --> 00:18:58,178
Are you happy too?

288
00:18:58,262 --> 00:19:00,305
-Of course, I am.
-All right. Here you go.

289
00:19:00,389 --> 00:19:03,142
[suspenseful music playing]

290
00:19:11,775 --> 00:19:13,527
I knew it. You're a traitor!

291
00:19:13,819 --> 00:19:16,321
[suspenseful music continues]

292
00:19:18,365 --> 00:19:19,658
Hey. What is going on?

293
00:19:21,243 --> 00:19:22,995
Madam, he's spying on us!

294
00:19:23,078 --> 00:19:24,079
Diego!

295
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:26,498
-Agent Salonga.
-Let's go.

296
00:19:26,582 --> 00:19:27,833
Men, move, move, move!

297
00:19:32,045 --> 00:19:33,213
You bastard!

298
00:19:33,755 --> 00:19:36,258
[suspenseful music playing]

299
00:19:39,469 --> 00:19:40,929
Police! Don't move!

300
00:19:41,013 --> 00:19:43,390
-[gunshots]
-[Red Dragon screams]

301
00:19:51,648 --> 00:19:54,109
[gunshots resume]

302
00:20:06,455 --> 00:20:07,831
Get up!

303
00:20:07,915 --> 00:20:10,375
[suspenseful music playing]

304
00:20:27,726 --> 00:20:28,810
Let's go.

305
00:20:30,562 --> 00:20:31,521
Let's move.

306
00:20:31,605 --> 00:20:33,023
What are you waiting for?

307
00:20:33,273 --> 00:20:35,859
[suspenseful music continues]

308
00:20:40,030 --> 00:20:40,989
Gotcha.

309
00:20:44,618 --> 00:20:46,828
Caught you red-handed, Red Dragon.

310
00:20:56,338 --> 00:20:57,798
Trying to escape again?

311
00:20:57,881 --> 00:21:00,509
This time, I'll make sure
you won't get away.

312
00:21:00,592 --> 00:21:01,677
[car door opens]

313
00:21:09,393 --> 00:21:11,228
You have the right to remain silent.

314
00:21:11,311 --> 00:21:13,355
Anything you say can
and will be used against you

315
00:21:13,438 --> 00:21:14,773
in a court of law.

316
00:21:14,856 --> 00:21:16,275
You have the right to an attorney

317
00:21:16,358 --> 00:21:17,401
and have him present with you

318
00:21:17,484 --> 00:21:19,069
while you are being questioned.

319
00:21:19,152 --> 00:21:20,279
If you can't afford one,

320
00:21:20,362 --> 00:21:21,947
one will be appointed to represent you

321
00:21:22,030 --> 00:21:24,032
for any questioning if you wish.

322
00:21:24,116 --> 00:21:27,077
You can decide at any time
to exercise these rights

323
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:30,497
or not answer any questions
or make any statements.

324
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:33,208
[ominous music playing]

325
00:21:38,255 --> 00:21:40,507
Don't celebrate yet, Lily Cruz.

326
00:21:41,008 --> 00:21:42,384
This isn't over.

327
00:21:42,467 --> 00:21:43,719
I won't let you get away with this!

328
00:21:43,802 --> 00:21:47,014
-I'll make you pay!
-Empty threats, Red Dragon!

329
00:21:47,097 --> 00:21:48,140
You're all talk!

330
00:21:48,223 --> 00:21:50,350
You really are Emilia's mother.

331
00:21:50,434 --> 00:21:52,561
You both think you breathe fire,

332
00:21:52,644 --> 00:21:54,479
but all you blow is hot air!

333
00:21:54,563 --> 00:21:56,565
And you, Diego Torillo!

334
00:21:56,648 --> 00:21:59,067
You will pay for this treachery!

335
00:21:59,151 --> 00:22:00,277
Mark my words!

336
00:22:00,861 --> 00:22:02,571
You will both pay!

337
00:22:02,654 --> 00:22:05,073
You will both burn in hell!

338
00:22:05,157 --> 00:22:08,076
I will burn you two alive!

339
00:22:08,160 --> 00:22:10,454
-[Red Dragon screams]
-[Lily laughs]

340
00:22:11,163 --> 00:22:13,165
Aww. Go on, Agent Salonga.

341
00:22:13,248 --> 00:22:15,917
How sad. The dragon is throwing a fit.

342
00:22:16,001 --> 00:22:17,210
-Let's go.
-[grunts]

343
00:22:17,294 --> 00:22:20,005
[tense music playing]

344
00:22:34,061 --> 00:22:36,980
[tense music continues]

345
00:22:52,871 --> 00:22:55,457
[breathes heavily]

346
00:22:55,540 --> 00:22:58,376
-[screams]
-[glass breaks]

347
00:22:59,669 --> 00:23:01,254
That Diego Torillo!

348
00:23:02,672 --> 00:23:05,175
He made my mother look like a fool!

349
00:23:05,258 --> 00:23:08,386
You! All of you! Get out! Get out!

350
00:23:08,929 --> 00:23:11,556
[tense music playing]

351
00:23:17,395 --> 00:23:21,775
Lily and Diego, this is the last straw.

352
00:23:22,442 --> 00:23:24,069
But just remember

353
00:23:24,152 --> 00:23:28,323
that Baby Dragon is
still here out to get you.

354
00:23:28,406 --> 00:23:31,368
[tense music continues]

355
00:23:41,253 --> 00:23:44,256
[soft piano music playing]

356
00:24:00,772 --> 00:24:03,441
<i>This is all new to me, Jepoy.</i>

357
00:24:04,359 --> 00:24:09,114
<i>But I know and I'm sure</i>
<i>that you will never hurt me.</i>

358
00:24:09,197 --> 00:24:12,117
[soft piano music continues]

359
00:24:16,955 --> 00:24:18,707
<i>I'm ready, Jepoy.</i>

360
00:24:18,790 --> 00:24:24,004
<i>I'll give you my all</i>
<i>because I love you too.</i>

361
00:24:24,087 --> 00:24:26,840
[soft piano music playing]

362
00:24:37,642 --> 00:24:39,186
[knocking on door]

363
00:24:40,061 --> 00:24:42,731
[unsettling music playing]

364
00:24:46,109 --> 00:24:48,528
-Ouch.
-Hello, lover boy.

365
00:24:49,237 --> 00:24:50,530
You know, you're--

366
00:24:51,656 --> 00:24:52,657
Yes?

367
00:24:53,533 --> 00:24:54,993
Where are my weapons?

368
00:24:55,869 --> 00:24:57,370
What did you say?

369
00:24:58,163 --> 00:25:00,081
I said where are my guns?

370
00:25:00,582 --> 00:25:01,541
Oh!

371
00:25:04,002 --> 00:25:06,463
You don't have to be so mad.

372
00:25:13,178 --> 00:25:14,012
Give them back.

373
00:25:15,096 --> 00:25:16,890
Like I said, Madrigal,

374
00:25:16,973 --> 00:25:21,436
if you want it, come and get it.

375
00:25:23,355 --> 00:25:25,398
-You're really pushing me.
-One, two…

376
00:25:25,482 --> 00:25:27,901
[unsettling music continues]

377
00:25:31,238 --> 00:25:32,322
Natalie.

378
00:25:32,864 --> 00:25:33,907
Natalie!

379
00:25:35,367 --> 00:25:36,826
I missed you, Madrigal.

380
00:25:37,452 --> 00:25:39,371
I know she can't give you…

381
00:25:39,454 --> 00:25:41,039
-…what you need.
-Stop it!

382
00:25:41,873 --> 00:25:44,167
And you know that I can.

383
00:25:44,251 --> 00:25:45,961
You remember, right?

384
00:25:47,170 --> 00:25:48,213
Hmm?

385
00:25:50,799 --> 00:25:52,676
I'm going to surprise Jepoy.

386
00:25:53,093 --> 00:25:56,137
[tense music playing]

387
00:25:57,889 --> 00:25:59,099
Natalie, stop.

388
00:25:59,182 --> 00:26:01,559
Stop, Natalie! We've talked about this!

389
00:26:03,436 --> 00:26:05,230
Stop resisting, Madrigal.

390
00:26:07,357 --> 00:26:10,443
You know, you can trust me.

391
00:26:11,861 --> 00:26:15,156
It can be our little secret.

392
00:26:15,991 --> 00:26:17,325
I'm not gonna tell her.

393
00:26:18,076 --> 00:26:19,661
And I know you won't.

394
00:26:21,121 --> 00:26:24,457
It could be for old times' sake.

395
00:26:26,251 --> 00:26:27,836
For the last time.

396
00:26:28,461 --> 00:26:29,587
Promise.

397
00:26:29,671 --> 00:26:32,674
[sensual music playing]

398
00:26:32,757 --> 00:26:34,843
-Is this what you want?
-Mm-hm.

399
00:26:36,177 --> 00:26:37,679
-Hmm?
-[giggles]

400
00:26:38,346 --> 00:26:40,015
This? Is this what you want?

401
00:26:40,098 --> 00:26:41,016
Mm-hm.

402
00:26:41,099 --> 00:26:43,518
[sensual music continues]

403
00:26:48,732 --> 00:26:49,858
[exhales]

404
00:26:56,281 --> 00:26:57,824
Are you gonna punish me?

405
00:26:58,116 --> 00:26:59,784
I'm going to hurt you.

406
00:26:59,868 --> 00:27:02,704
[tense music playing]

407
00:27:07,500 --> 00:27:09,127
You love Jepoy, Anna.

408
00:27:09,586 --> 00:27:11,087
You don't have to be scared.

409
00:27:11,671 --> 00:27:14,966
Jepoy would never hurt you
because he loves you.

410
00:27:15,050 --> 00:27:17,969
[tense music continues]

411
00:27:34,944 --> 00:27:35,904
[clicks]

412
00:27:35,987 --> 00:27:37,238
[door creaks]

413
00:27:42,535 --> 00:27:46,581
[tense music playing]

414
00:27:51,378 --> 00:27:52,462
Jepoy.

415
00:28:02,305 --> 00:28:03,390
Hi, Anna.

416
00:28:08,937 --> 00:28:10,980
[breathes heavily]

417
00:28:17,737 --> 00:28:19,656
Anna, it's not what you think.

418
00:28:22,075 --> 00:28:23,743
Anna! Anna!

419
00:28:27,455 --> 00:28:28,498
What have I done?

420
00:28:28,581 --> 00:28:31,126
[tense music playing]

421
00:28:33,128 --> 00:28:34,421
This is your fault!

422
00:28:35,839 --> 00:28:37,674
-[squeals]
-This is all your fault!

423
00:28:38,883 --> 00:28:40,719
Anna! Anna!

424
00:28:42,095 --> 00:28:43,722
Anna, wait!

425
00:28:44,806 --> 00:28:46,182
Poor, Madrigal.

426
00:28:47,350 --> 00:28:53,189
He doesn't even know it yet,
but he's gonna be all mine.

427
00:28:53,523 --> 00:28:54,649
[chuckles]

428
00:28:58,069 --> 00:28:59,279
[sobbing]

429
00:29:00,864 --> 00:29:04,117
You liar!

430
00:29:09,622 --> 00:29:11,124
You're disgusting!

431
00:29:12,751 --> 00:29:14,002
[sobbing]

432
00:29:14,085 --> 00:29:15,962
Anna! Anna!

433
00:29:16,588 --> 00:29:18,173
Anna, I'm sorry.

434
00:29:18,256 --> 00:29:20,258
Anna, wait. Wait. Please forgive me.

435
00:29:20,341 --> 00:29:21,468
Sorry, sorry, sorry.

436
00:29:24,471 --> 00:29:25,472
Sorry.

437
00:29:28,266 --> 00:29:31,311
Get your hands off me, you liar!

438
00:29:31,394 --> 00:29:32,145
Anna.

439
00:29:32,228 --> 00:29:34,147
-How could you do this to me?
-Please. I'm sorry.

440
00:29:34,230 --> 00:29:35,356
Sorry.

441
00:29:36,649 --> 00:29:37,734
I didn't mean to.

442
00:29:38,443 --> 00:29:39,360
I didn't mean it.

443
00:29:39,444 --> 00:29:41,029
Oh, really?

444
00:29:41,738 --> 00:29:42,572
Sorry.

445
00:29:42,655 --> 00:29:46,367
You didn't mean to lie
and hurt me, Jepoy?!

446
00:29:49,370 --> 00:29:51,080
I'm such an idiot!

447
00:29:53,082 --> 00:29:58,129
I was so stupid to think you
were different from other men!

448
00:29:59,172 --> 00:30:01,591
But, it turns out you're worse!

449
00:30:03,718 --> 00:30:05,261
[sobbing]

450
00:30:06,429 --> 00:30:08,056
I didn't mean to, Anna.

451
00:30:09,808 --> 00:30:12,811
I was weak. Please forgive me.

452
00:30:12,894 --> 00:30:14,479
-Don't touch me!
-Please forgive me.

453
00:30:14,562 --> 00:30:17,065
-Don't…
-Please forgive me.

454
00:30:17,148 --> 00:30:18,691
You're the only one I love, Anna.

455
00:30:18,775 --> 00:30:21,110
No one else! Just you!

456
00:30:21,569 --> 00:30:23,780
Just you, I swear!

457
00:30:24,614 --> 00:30:27,325
I thought you'd never hurt me.

458
00:30:28,576 --> 00:30:31,079
And we've been friends for so long!

459
00:30:31,162 --> 00:30:34,374
We've always treated each
other like family, remember?

460
00:30:35,083 --> 00:30:38,837
Jepoy, in every future
I dreamed of, you were in it!

461
00:30:39,671 --> 00:30:43,341
I was ready to give you all of me!

462
00:30:45,093 --> 00:30:49,389
But you threw it all away for that woman!

463
00:30:51,266 --> 00:30:53,226
Sorry. Sorry.

464
00:30:53,893 --> 00:30:56,396
Sorry, Anna. Sorry. Sorry, sorry, sorry.

465
00:30:56,855 --> 00:30:58,189
Sorry. Sorry.

466
00:30:58,690 --> 00:31:01,693
-Jepoy.
-Sorry, Anna. Please.

467
00:31:01,776 --> 00:31:03,027
I'm sorry.

468
00:31:03,111 --> 00:31:06,322
Anna, please forgive me.

469
00:31:08,283 --> 00:31:10,118
If it's Natalie you want,

470
00:31:11,035 --> 00:31:12,662
then just go with her.

471
00:31:12,745 --> 00:31:15,206
No. You're the one I want, Anna.

472
00:31:15,874 --> 00:31:18,459
You two disgust me.

473
00:31:18,543 --> 00:31:19,669
No, Anna.

474
00:31:22,088 --> 00:31:23,172
Anna.

475
00:31:25,008 --> 00:31:26,551
Please, Anna!

476
00:31:26,885 --> 00:31:29,679
[solemn music playing]

477
00:31:31,556 --> 00:31:32,932
[exhales]

478
00:31:36,394 --> 00:31:37,854
[sobs]

479
00:31:53,036 --> 00:31:54,662
[sobs]

480
00:31:58,333 --> 00:32:00,376
[sniffles and sobs]

481
00:32:01,961 --> 00:32:03,504
Open the door, please.

482
00:32:04,464 --> 00:32:06,424
Montoya! You have a visitor.

483
00:32:07,008 --> 00:32:09,969
[unsettling music playing]

484
00:32:11,679 --> 00:32:12,889
[lock opens]

485
00:32:20,021 --> 00:32:22,523
[unsettling music continues]

486
00:32:25,568 --> 00:32:26,569
Mama.

487
00:32:28,738 --> 00:32:31,658
-Mama, how are you?
-I'm good.

488
00:32:32,450 --> 00:32:33,701
[sighs]

489
00:32:33,785 --> 00:32:36,412
Mama, I hope you're not
blaming me for what happened.

490
00:32:38,247 --> 00:32:39,290
Emilia.

491
00:32:39,874 --> 00:32:44,003
I trusted you with this transaction.

492
00:32:45,254 --> 00:32:48,758
Do you realize how much money
we lost because we failed?

493
00:32:49,592 --> 00:32:51,928
But I did everything I could, Mama.

494
00:32:52,011 --> 00:32:54,347
Then explain to me how we got caught!

495
00:32:57,141 --> 00:32:58,977
It's Lily Cruz, Mama.

496
00:32:59,560 --> 00:33:02,146
She doesn't know how to give up.

497
00:33:02,230 --> 00:33:05,358
You know, ever since
she started investigating you,

498
00:33:05,441 --> 00:33:07,986
all the way until you went
to Macau and back,

499
00:33:08,069 --> 00:33:09,654
she's been acting like a superhero.

500
00:33:09,737 --> 00:33:11,447
And now, she thinks she's a special agent.

501
00:33:11,531 --> 00:33:14,784
If you have connections in
law enforcement, she does too.

502
00:33:14,867 --> 00:33:16,077
She doesn't want to give up!

503
00:33:16,160 --> 00:33:17,996
And that Diego Torillo, Mama.

504
00:33:18,079 --> 00:33:19,580
That bastard!

505
00:33:19,664 --> 00:33:23,251
You know, you never heard from me,
Mama, because I trusted you!

506
00:33:23,334 --> 00:33:26,379
Because I thought you had a plan
to use him against Lily Cruz!

507
00:33:26,462 --> 00:33:27,964
Well, I did have a plan!

508
00:33:28,047 --> 00:33:29,257
Yes, but what happened?

509
00:33:29,340 --> 00:33:31,175
Lily Cruz got to you first.

510
00:33:31,259 --> 00:33:33,094
She defeated us.

511
00:33:33,177 --> 00:33:34,804
We just lost to her again,

512
00:33:34,887 --> 00:33:36,806
and I won't stand for it, Mama!

513
00:33:36,889 --> 00:33:38,266
I won't let this slide.

514
00:33:38,349 --> 00:33:39,892
I'm going to get you out of here,

515
00:33:39,976 --> 00:33:41,936
and we're going to make her pay.

516
00:33:42,020 --> 00:33:44,689
Don't make promises, Emilia. Fulfill them.

517
00:33:45,565 --> 00:33:48,359
And this time, you better not fail.

518
00:33:49,652 --> 00:33:50,570
Okay, Mama.

519
00:33:52,238 --> 00:33:54,991
I'll be needing every cent
from your piggy bank.

520
00:33:55,658 --> 00:33:58,745
I'll be using that to crush Lily Cruz.

521
00:33:59,746 --> 00:34:02,165
But the problem is, Mama,
you're left with nothing.

522
00:34:02,248 --> 00:34:03,374
Your account is frozen.

523
00:34:03,458 --> 00:34:06,210
Your properties and assets are gone.

524
00:34:06,294 --> 00:34:09,380
Technically speaking,
you have nothing, Mama.

525
00:34:10,089 --> 00:34:11,174
Zero.

526
00:34:11,674 --> 00:34:14,427
That is where you're wrong, Emilia.

527
00:34:16,095 --> 00:34:17,388
What do you mean, Mama?

528
00:34:17,472 --> 00:34:18,973
Do you have some hidden money?

529
00:34:19,057 --> 00:34:23,061
Yes, I do have my hidden wealth.

530
00:34:23,144 --> 00:34:25,480
[tense music playing]

531
00:34:25,563 --> 00:34:28,441
Helena Montoya's reputation is ruined.

532
00:34:28,524 --> 00:34:29,984
But, Diego, that's not enough.

533
00:34:30,068 --> 00:34:32,570
I want her to lose her power.

534
00:34:32,653 --> 00:34:34,781
And for that to happen,

535
00:34:34,864 --> 00:34:36,491
she needs to lose all her money.

536
00:34:36,574 --> 00:34:40,328
I'm sure she's still got
a secret stash of money.

537
00:34:41,662 --> 00:34:42,747
You're right.

538
00:34:43,247 --> 00:34:46,334
I discovered another one
of Helena Montoya's secrets.

539
00:34:46,417 --> 00:34:47,877
And once we expose it,

540
00:34:47,960 --> 00:34:50,338
she'll lose her power for sure.

541
00:34:53,257 --> 00:34:56,302
[tense music playing]

542
00:35:04,102 --> 00:35:07,647
[Diego] <i>I saw them loading</i>
<i>sacks of cash into a vehicle.</i>

543
00:35:09,315 --> 00:35:10,691
<i>So, I followed them.</i>

544
00:35:13,611 --> 00:35:16,030
<i>Romulo, do you have the money Madam sent?</i>

545
00:35:16,114 --> 00:35:16,989
<i>It's all here.</i>

546
00:35:17,448 --> 00:35:18,741
<i>Go ahead and unload it.</i>

547
00:35:19,242 --> 00:35:20,201
<i>Hurry.</i>

548
00:35:20,284 --> 00:35:22,870
[tense music playing]

549
00:35:24,872 --> 00:35:25,790
<i>Let's go.</i>

550
00:35:26,457 --> 00:35:29,836
[Diego] <i>So, if Red Dragon is hiding money,</i>

551
00:35:29,919 --> 00:35:31,712
<i>I know where we can find it.</i>

552
00:35:33,965 --> 00:35:37,802
<i>But the area is loaded</i>
<i>with CCTV cameras and guards.</i>

553
00:35:37,885 --> 00:35:40,888
The whole place is built like Fort Knox.

554
00:35:42,140 --> 00:35:44,642
And if security is that tight,

555
00:35:45,184 --> 00:35:46,978
I don't think it's just loose change

556
00:35:47,061 --> 00:35:48,396
she's got stacked in there.

557
00:35:50,022 --> 00:35:54,318
Now, Red Dragon isn't
just planning her escape.

558
00:35:54,944 --> 00:35:59,448
She's figuring out a way
to protect her hidden wealth.

559
00:36:02,368 --> 00:36:03,578
[Emilia] <i>I knew it.</i>

560
00:36:03,661 --> 00:36:05,997
Someone like you has deep pockets.

561
00:36:06,080 --> 00:36:09,000
No one else knows about this
except for Romulo.

562
00:36:09,083 --> 00:36:11,043
Now, he's in prison.

563
00:36:12,128 --> 00:36:15,882
That means you're the only person
I can trust, Emilia.

564
00:36:17,008 --> 00:36:19,719
So now, you have to act fast.

565
00:36:19,802 --> 00:36:23,097
Secure my money as soon as possible.

566
00:36:23,181 --> 00:36:25,391
[tense music playing]

567
00:36:25,474 --> 00:36:26,726
Thanks, Mama.

568
00:36:27,351 --> 00:36:29,395
Thank you, Mama, for trusting me again.

569
00:36:29,937 --> 00:36:31,397
I will not fail you.

570
00:36:31,480 --> 00:36:32,815
And I assure you, Emilia,

571
00:36:33,441 --> 00:36:34,984
no matter how many times

572
00:36:35,067 --> 00:36:36,777
Lily Cruz tries to bring us down,

573
00:36:36,861 --> 00:36:38,863
as long as we have money,

574
00:36:39,780 --> 00:36:41,657
we have power.

575
00:36:42,325 --> 00:36:47,622
The one and only Red Dragon
will rise again and again.

576
00:36:47,705 --> 00:36:50,249
[tense music continues]

577
00:36:53,252 --> 00:36:55,296
[Lily] <i>Here's what we'll do, Diego.</i>

578
00:36:55,379 --> 00:36:58,299
We need to make sure we get
our hands on Helena's money

579
00:36:58,382 --> 00:36:59,175
before she does.

580
00:36:59,884 --> 00:37:02,511
That's what we need to do,
so we can make sure

581
00:37:02,595 --> 00:37:04,555
that woman loses everything she has.

582
00:37:07,141 --> 00:37:10,061
I'll see you at the
finish line, Red Dragon,

583
00:37:10,144 --> 00:37:12,897
and may the best woman win.

584
00:37:14,649 --> 00:37:15,691
[Camia] Lily.

585
00:37:17,235 --> 00:37:19,779
-I'm glad you're both safe.
-Yes, Mom.

586
00:37:19,862 --> 00:37:21,322
-Diego.
-Auntie.

587
00:37:21,405 --> 00:37:23,741
[somber music playing]

588
00:37:25,243 --> 00:37:28,120
Red Dragon and her lackeys
have been caught.

589
00:37:28,204 --> 00:37:31,666
That's great. All thanks to you two.

590
00:37:42,468 --> 00:37:44,095
<i>This isn't the end.</i>

591
00:37:45,096 --> 00:37:48,516
<i>A dragon doesn't just stop breathing fire.</i>

592
00:37:49,267 --> 00:37:50,935
<i>Though I hope you still accept me</i>

593
00:37:51,018 --> 00:37:53,437
<i>when you find out who I really am.</i>

594
00:37:53,521 --> 00:37:56,357
[somber music continues]

595
00:37:59,443 --> 00:38:01,153
[reporter] <i>Authorities nabbed</i>

596
00:38:01,237 --> 00:38:04,156
<i>international syndicate</i>
<i>leader, Red Dragon,</i>

597
00:38:04,240 --> 00:38:06,492
<i>in an entrapment</i>
<i>operation conducted by the NBI</i>

598
00:38:06,575 --> 00:38:08,577
<i>through the help of famed</i>
<i>businesswoman, Lily Cruz.</i>

599
00:38:09,745 --> 00:38:12,081
This is what I'm talking about.

600
00:38:12,832 --> 00:38:18,087
That is why I will never send
a woman to do a man's job.

601
00:38:18,462 --> 00:38:20,006
Bet your bottom dollar

602
00:38:20,089 --> 00:38:22,633
that women will just mess up everything.

603
00:38:23,467 --> 00:38:26,012
What's the biggest mistake
of that syndicate?

604
00:38:26,887 --> 00:38:30,099
They allowed a woman to be their leader.

605
00:38:30,516 --> 00:38:31,559
[reporter] <i>According to reports,</i>

606
00:38:31,642 --> 00:38:33,144
<i>Diego Torillo played a huge part</i>

607
00:38:33,227 --> 00:38:35,146
<i>in Red Dragon's arrest</i>

608
00:38:35,229 --> 00:38:38,691
<i>by infiltrating the group</i>
<i>as a double agent.</i>

609
00:38:38,774 --> 00:38:40,067
There's another one.

610
00:38:40,568 --> 00:38:44,989
I am starting to have a new-found respect

611
00:38:45,656 --> 00:38:49,660
for that bastard half-brother of yours.

612
00:38:50,453 --> 00:38:51,495
You know why?

613
00:38:52,246 --> 00:38:53,289
Number one.

614
00:38:54,248 --> 00:38:56,417
He ended up killing Colonel Sanggano.

615
00:38:57,168 --> 00:39:00,588
And that is a feat by itself already.

616
00:39:01,255 --> 00:39:02,256
Second…

617
00:39:03,257 --> 00:39:05,593
Who would have thought

618
00:39:05,676 --> 00:39:08,763
he'd drive your grandmother into a corner?

619
00:39:11,349 --> 00:39:14,143
[laughs]

620
00:39:20,191 --> 00:39:22,151
-Wait, I'm sorry.
-What's so funny?

621
00:39:22,234 --> 00:39:24,111
No, no, no. I'm sorry.

622
00:39:25,529 --> 00:39:26,655
Well…

623
00:39:28,908 --> 00:39:30,076
This is just my opinion.

624
00:39:31,327 --> 00:39:34,330
Diego only manages to score now because…

625
00:39:36,082 --> 00:39:37,375
I'm watching from the sidelines.

626
00:39:38,876 --> 00:39:40,669
But now that I'm back…

627
00:39:42,171 --> 00:39:43,923
I'll put him in his rightful place.

628
00:39:44,340 --> 00:39:46,133
My baby brother.

629
00:39:48,677 --> 00:39:53,682
You know you're getting
scarier as the days go by.

630
00:39:54,809 --> 00:39:56,435
You're becoming more cunning.

631
00:39:56,519 --> 00:39:58,979
You're becoming slyer than I am.

632
00:39:59,063 --> 00:39:59,980
[chuckles]

633
00:40:00,064 --> 00:40:01,399
Now I can truly say…

634
00:40:02,942 --> 00:40:04,568
that you don't have dragon blood in you.

635
00:40:05,778 --> 00:40:09,198
The only thing running through your veins…

636
00:40:09,865 --> 00:40:16,580
is pure, unadulterated Ardiente blood.

637
00:40:17,373 --> 00:40:19,667
-[exhales]
-That's what makes you run.

638
00:40:20,459 --> 00:40:21,460
[sighs]

639
00:40:22,336 --> 00:40:23,504
[clears throat]

640
00:40:24,338 --> 00:40:25,297
Grandpa.

641
00:40:26,340 --> 00:40:28,300
Bless you. Bless you.

642
00:40:28,384 --> 00:40:29,969
[chuckles]

643
00:40:30,594 --> 00:40:32,513
I am blessed!

644
00:40:32,596 --> 00:40:36,183
I'm just so blessed because I was given…

645
00:40:36,267 --> 00:40:39,687
-a grandson like you!
-Oh, come on.

646
00:40:39,770 --> 00:40:41,063
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

647
00:40:41,147 --> 00:40:42,982
-Viva, Ardiente!
-Viva, Ardiente!

648
00:40:43,065 --> 00:40:44,483
[laughs maniacally]

649
00:40:44,567 --> 00:40:46,193
[line rings]

650
00:40:46,277 --> 00:40:47,611
[intercept tone]

651
00:40:48,779 --> 00:40:50,990
Anna, why aren't you picking up?

652
00:40:51,949 --> 00:40:53,117
[line rings]

653
00:40:53,534 --> 00:40:55,828
-[intercept tone]
-You too, Jepoy.

654
00:41:06,005 --> 00:41:07,089
It's late.

655
00:41:07,173 --> 00:41:09,300
I've been trying to reach Anna and Jepoy,

656
00:41:09,383 --> 00:41:10,968
but they won't pick up.

657
00:41:11,677 --> 00:41:13,804
You're worrying about
your friends too much.

658
00:41:14,180 --> 00:41:16,098
Diego, you know me.

659
00:41:16,182 --> 00:41:20,144
I can't help but worry
about the people I love,

660
00:41:20,227 --> 00:41:21,645
and by that, I mean all of you.

661
00:41:24,857 --> 00:41:26,108
Like how I worry about you?

662
00:41:27,651 --> 00:41:28,819
Diego.

663
00:41:30,321 --> 00:41:31,489
What?

664
00:41:31,572 --> 00:41:33,449
[romantic music playing]

665
00:41:33,532 --> 00:41:35,493
I'm ready to give up my life for you.

666
00:41:36,452 --> 00:41:40,289
I know that. You've proven
that so many times now.

667
00:41:40,873 --> 00:41:45,127
For that, I'm thankful because
you're back by my side.

668
00:41:45,419 --> 00:41:47,963
[romantic music continues]

669
00:41:53,177 --> 00:41:55,262
Because we're soulmates.

670
00:41:56,722 --> 00:41:59,141
[romantic music playing]

671
00:42:01,852 --> 00:42:03,437
I was so lost.

672
00:42:05,272 --> 00:42:06,649
I ended up killing someone.

673
00:42:10,444 --> 00:42:11,862
But you didn't give up on me.

674
00:42:15,574 --> 00:42:17,159
You pulled me from the edge.

675
00:42:20,996 --> 00:42:22,164
Thank you.

676
00:42:23,165 --> 00:42:25,251
I'll always be here for you, Diego.

677
00:42:26,168 --> 00:42:28,462
No matter what happens…

678
00:42:30,256 --> 00:42:31,590
I'll always be by your side.

679
00:42:32,466 --> 00:42:33,884
We'll always be together.

680
00:42:35,094 --> 00:42:37,179
And I don't want to lose you again.

681
00:42:40,641 --> 00:42:42,268
That won't happen again.

682
00:42:44,061 --> 00:42:45,563
I promise you…

683
00:42:48,107 --> 00:42:49,775
that you'll never lose me.

684
00:42:49,858 --> 00:42:52,444
[romantic music playing]

685
00:42:57,366 --> 00:43:00,035
We've been through a lot lately.

686
00:43:02,663 --> 00:43:04,373
So now, let's make things easier.

687
00:43:06,000 --> 00:43:10,963
I know we're in
the middle of a war, Diego.

688
00:43:15,259 --> 00:43:17,344
But I think it's worth the fight

689
00:43:17,428 --> 00:43:19,138
when you aren't alone.

690
00:43:22,099 --> 00:43:23,100
Diego.

691
00:43:25,436 --> 00:43:26,812
From now on…

692
00:43:29,440 --> 00:43:30,774
let's make it official.

693
00:43:35,362 --> 00:43:36,488
Will you be mine?

694
00:43:36,822 --> 00:43:39,241
[romantic music playing]

695
00:43:40,659 --> 00:43:41,827
[chuckles lightly]

696
00:43:47,249 --> 00:43:48,250
Well?

697
00:43:52,796 --> 00:43:53,922
Yes.

698
00:43:54,882 --> 00:43:56,634
-I'm all yours.
-[chuckles]

699
00:43:56,717 --> 00:44:00,179
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" playing]

700
00:44:28,832 --> 00:44:30,834
[breathes heavily]

701
00:44:40,094 --> 00:44:42,429
[song fades]

702
00:44:43,472 --> 00:44:45,683
[tense music playing]

703
00:44:45,766 --> 00:44:46,975
[Diego] That's the area.

704
00:44:47,935 --> 00:44:49,728
That's where I followed Romulo.

705
00:44:52,147 --> 00:44:54,942
[Diego] <i>I'm sure that's where</i>
<i>he brought Red Dragon's money.</i>

706
00:44:55,567 --> 00:44:57,820
There are lots of guards
and security cameras.

707
00:44:59,405 --> 00:45:01,657
[Lily] It's like a fortress
you can't penetrate.

708
00:45:02,658 --> 00:45:06,578
I wonder how vast Red Dragon's fortune is,

709
00:45:06,662 --> 00:45:08,872
for her to protect it like that.

710
00:45:08,956 --> 00:45:10,416
No one knows.

711
00:45:10,499 --> 00:45:13,127
But Red Dragon really wants
to keep her wealth secure.

712
00:45:13,669 --> 00:45:15,838
There are high walls surrounding it.

713
00:45:19,091 --> 00:45:23,303
I don't care how high those walls are.

714
00:45:23,387 --> 00:45:26,723
I can tear anything down.

715
00:45:26,807 --> 00:45:29,768
[tense music continues]

716
00:45:33,147 --> 00:45:34,565
That Diego's a bastard.

717
00:45:34,648 --> 00:45:37,651
I told her from the start
that you can't trust that man!

718
00:45:37,734 --> 00:45:40,404
I'm going to kill him
once I get out of here.

719
00:45:40,487 --> 00:45:43,407
Chill, Romulo. Chill. Come on, calm down.

720
00:45:43,490 --> 00:45:47,786
I know we both want Diego dead.

721
00:45:47,870 --> 00:45:49,580
But first things first,

722
00:45:49,663 --> 00:45:54,042
you need to tell me everything
you know about Mama's riches.

723
00:45:54,126 --> 00:45:56,295
Because as of now, you and I

724
00:45:56,378 --> 00:45:58,630
are the only people that Mama trusts.

725
00:45:58,714 --> 00:46:00,507
That's why you need to tell me everything.

726
00:46:00,591 --> 00:46:02,176
We need to work together,

727
00:46:02,259 --> 00:46:05,262
so we can recover Mama's entire fortune.

728
00:46:05,345 --> 00:46:07,973
[tense music playing]

729
00:46:18,108 --> 00:46:21,403
[ominous music playing]

730
00:46:47,930 --> 00:46:51,391
<i>How can she make a comeback</i>
<i>when she's dirt-poor?!</i>

731
00:46:51,475 --> 00:46:54,853
[Emilia] <i>What the police have is</i>
<i>only the tip of the iceberg.</i>

732
00:46:54,937 --> 00:46:58,690
[Lily] <i>I don't care how high</i>
<i>those walls are.</i>

733
00:46:58,774 --> 00:47:02,986
[Julio] <i>You and I have a</i>
<i>common enemy-- Lily Cruz.</i>

734
00:47:03,070 --> 00:47:07,366
<i>What if I can tell you</i>
<i>that I can offer you</i>

735
00:47:07,449 --> 00:47:10,202
<i>that alliance against Lily Cruz,</i>

736
00:47:10,285 --> 00:47:12,079
<i>and, most importantly,</i>

737
00:47:12,162 --> 00:47:15,874
<i>that I can guarantee your freedom?</i>

738
00:47:17,834 --> 00:47:20,420
[theme music playing]
